# Public storefront catalog + checkout — WooCommerce's public Store API
# (no secret key needed; this app calls it directly from the browser).
# Unset = the storefront serves the static fallback catalog in
# src/data/products.ts instead (real photos, no live backend), and
# checkout is disabled.
#
# Vite only exposes env vars prefixed VITE_ to client code, and this app
# has no server of its own (it's a static SPA), so every var here is
# public by definition — never put a real secret in a VITE_ var.
VITE_WOO_STORE_URL=https://yourstore.com

# On the WordPress side, set the matching storefront origin (this app's
# own deployed URL, e.g. https://longevitypeptides.com) in:
#   - WooCommerce → Payment Gateways → NiftiPay → Headless Storefront URL
#   - Longevity Peptides Content Manager → Site Settings → Storefront origin (CORS)
# Both are required for checkout to work cross-origin with cookies.
